  skillDescription: 'Base (1★): Applies chill to slow and freeze enemies. Freezing an enemy grants 25% faster attacks for 3.5 seconds. Every 4th attack fires 1 extra shard at another enemy in range, or the same enemy if alone. 1st upgrade (2★): While Chillpath is deployed, all operators deal 50% more damage to frozen enemies. 2nd upgrade (3★): Fires 3 shards per attack at different enemies when possible, repeating targets if fewer than 3 are in range. The every-4th-attack bonus adds 1 more shard, for 4 total. Her freeze haste remains.'
