  projectileOrigin: {x: -0.13, y: -2}
  intelQuote: Slow down. Breathe. Freeze.
  intelLore: A frost-furred cat whose paws stay cold even on the floor of the NERC Works Plant. Chillpath frosts enemies until they lock up solid, and works faster once something stops moving. It treats every fight like an unhurried winter walk.
